# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Local agent progress ledger (intentionally not versioned)
/.agent_progress.md

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Rendered screenshots for reviewing the UI by eye. Regenerate with:
#   flutter test test/screenshots/render_ui.dart --update-goldens
# Not versioned: they depend on the fonts installed on the machine that drew
# them, so they are a review aid rather than a regression test.
/test/screenshots/goldens/

# Repo hygiene: local-only working files
/docs/
/html_ref/
/html_refs/
# No markdown in the repo except README
*.md
!README.md
